  {
    question: 'Who is Qurbani / Udhiya obligatory for?',
    answer: 'Qurbani (Udhiya) is obligatory for every sane Muslim adult who possesses wealth above the Nisab threshold (equivalent to 87.48g of gold or 612.36g of silver) on the days of Eid al-Adha.',
